			<description><![CDATA[<b>2920 SHATTUCK Ave</b><br/><b>Units:</b> 242<br/><b>VLI Units:</b> 0<br/><b>Stories:</b> 11<br/><b>Height:</b> 38.2m<br/><b>Status:</b> In Review<br/><i>All figures from the project's own Tabulation Form 1.E dated 09/22/2025 (documents 2162), PROPOSED column: 242 dwelling units, 11 stories, 125'-2" average AND maximum height = 38.2 m, footprint 10,232 sf, lot 19,586 sf, coverage 52%. FEET BEAT STOREYS x 3.5 where a form states a height, so 38.2 m, not 11 x 3.5. Moved 4.97 m EAST 2026-08-26: the polygon had been synthesised as a box from the AREA alone and sat 5.0 m west of the Shattuck frontage of APN 53-1590-5-1, floating behind the sidewalk. The 1.E states a FRONT YARD SETBACK of "VARIES; 0 to 2'", so the east face belongs on the property line. Was 10 storeys / 35.0 m and a stale 221-unit body against a 242 label.</i>]]></description>
