		<Placemark>
			<name>2036 Bancroft Way · 87 units · In Review</name>
			<visibility>0</visibility>
			<description><![CDATA[<b>2036 BANCROFT Way</b><br/><b>Units:</b> 87<br/><b>VLI Units:</b> 4<br/><b>Stories:</b> 8<br/><b>Height:</b> 25.9m<br/><b>Status:</b> In Review<br/><i>Position MEASURED OFF SHEET A100 PROPOSED SITE PLAN (1"=10'-0") of the 2025-10-02 RESUB Entitlement Plan Set (documents 2253), not derived. Its key map dimensions the enlarged parcel directly: APN 55-1894-16 = <b>113'-1" along Bancroft x 130'-0" deep</b>, with 118'-10" remaining from its east edge to Shattuck Ave. Plan note 1: "A LOT LINE ADJUSTMENT FOR PARCELS (APN: 55-1894-16) &amp; (APN: 55-1894-17-4) WILL BE SUBMITTED FOR APPROVAL" — the tabulation books it as -016 growing 6,595 -&gt; 14,582 sf while -017-04 shrinks 37,696 -&gt; 29,709 sf (7,987 sf transfers, both sides matching exactly). Building placed to the sheet's dimensioned setbacks: <b>0' required on the east, (P) 7'-0" side setback on the west</b>, front 0'-0" per the tabulation, giving 32.3 x 33.4 m = 11,608 sf against the stated 11,610 and a 6.3 m rear gap against the drawing's 5'-0" minimum. West property line is -016's EXISTING line against 2028 Bancroft, unchanged by the adjustment. 8 storeys / 85 ft = 25.9 m. -017-04 retains the existing 4-storey 2300-2350 Shattuck building (office &amp; retail, HT 45'+/-, footprint 31,115 -&gt; 24,535 sf, height NO CHANGE). Units 87 per the plan set unit table (31 studio + 8 one-bed + 13 two-bed + 35 three-bed; 8 below-market-rate). SUPERSEDES a 30.8 x 35.0 m ring derived from lot area alone — right area, wrong shape — and before that a 11,636 sf box floating in the interior of -017-04, touching no street.</i>]]></description>
