			<description><![CDATA[<b>2538 DURANT Ave</b><br/><b>Units:</b> 83<br/><b>VLI Units:</b> 5<br/><b>Stories:</b> 8<br/><b>Height:</b> 28.0m<br/><b>Status:</b> Under Construction<br/><i>Footprint 10,465 sf from the architect tabulation's 'PROPOSED BUILDING - LOT COVERAGE DIAGRAM' (lot 12,792 sf); 10,465/12,792 = 81.8% reproduces the stated 82%. The 10,935 sf / 85% block is the existing condition. Was 6,275 sf. NOTE: MULTI-PARCEL SITE - the stated lot (12,792 sf) is 2.04x the single county parcel (6,275 sf), so extent across the second parcel is approximate; area and position are right.</i>]]></description>
